# Know One's Onions (windurst 40): the reply kinds of sections 4-6. Level 5, Windurst rank 2; Truth, Justice, and the
# Onion Way! accepted by GM (an earlier container, an Event line on every brigade member: Kohlo-Lakolo 371,
# Gomada-Vulmada 373, Papo-Hopo 372, Pichichi 374, Pyo Nzon 375, Shanruru 377, Yafa Yaa 376); this quest accepted by
# GM.
# - Section 4 (Prog 3): Kohlo-Lakolo's 400 (Progress) beats 371 (finished with a full bag: nothing); an Event 400 would
#   tie with 371. Each brigade line ties with the first quest's: one talk each, then the other.
# - Section 5 (rank 3; Prog 0, 1, 2): Kohlo-Lakolo's 389, 387 and 386 each tie with 371; the brigade's 405, 403, 411,
#   409, 412, 407 tie with the first quest's lines (Shanruru too). Of 386's two talks the one that plays 386 completes
#   the quest.
# - Section 6 (completed; Inspector's Gadget available by GM): each new default (replaceDefault) loses to the first
#   quest's Event line on both talks; without replaceDefault it would tie and play on one of them.
